{
  "name": "05 - KPI Watchdog",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "6742e737-bc24-4dbc-b5f7-7bdf06be200d",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1400,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 05 - KPI Watchdog\nScheduled metrics pull -> anomaly detection -> LLM executive digest.\n\n**Two ways in:** daily Schedule Trigger, or POST `/webhook/kpi-run` for on-demand demo runs.\n\n**Test hook:** POST body `{ \"testOverrides\": { \"overrides\": { \"github_stars\": 999999 }, \"forceSourceDown\": \"coingecko\", \"forceCrash\": false, \"forceCrash05a\": false } }` lets you inject an anomaly, simulate a dead metric source, force this workflow to fail, or force the 05a delivery sub-workflow to fail independently - all without waiting for real-world data to misbehave. A 05a failure is best-effort (`onError: continueRegularOutput` on the Execute Workflow node) - delivery failing does not crash a run whose analysis already succeeded.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6982cea3-762d-49ce-9175-c21c9bf80856",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Sources",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -900,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Metric sources (live public APIs, no auth)\n- GitHub: n8n-io/n8n stars\n- CoinGecko: BTC/USD\n- Open-Meteo: Boston temperature\n\nEach call: retryOnFail (3 tries, backoff wait), onError = continue. A dead source never kills the run - it just gets flagged `ok:false` and the digest calls it out by name.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "df03ad41-a863-4a98-af9d-5fb633948424",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Anomaly",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -140,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Anomaly detection\nRolling mean over prior runs per metric (from `kpi_history`). Flags when the current value deviates more than `THRESHOLD_PCT` (default 15%) from that mean. Threshold is a single named constant in **Detect Anomalies** - change it there.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c413e545-34cf-4b08-a92b-e9df50663a8b",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Digest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        500,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Digest + delivery\nBasic LLM Chain (OpenRouter -> claude-haiku-4.5) writes the executive digest, then hands off to **05a - Adapter: Digest Delivery** (Execute Workflow) which is the single swap point for Slack/email in production.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9aa51e4e-e5cf-42f2-886e-0480f8baa1bc",
      "name": "Schedule Trigger (Daily)",
